><span begin="02:06.060" end="02:07.080">Poison</span><span begin="02:07.240" end="02:07.830"> through</span><span begin="02:07.920" end="02:08.040"> my</span><span begin="02:08.080" end="02:08.990"> veins</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.990" end="02:12.470"><span begin="02:08.990" end="02:09.180">Took</span><span begin="02:09.340" end="02:10.370"> something,</span><span begin="02:10.540" end="02:10.980"> never</span><span begin="02:11.100" end="02:12.470"> explain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.470" end="02:18.450"><span begin="02:12.470" end="02:12.760">Why</span><span begin="02:12.790" end="02:12.970"> can't</span><span begin="02:13.260" end="02:14.080"> nobody</span><span begin="02:14.150" end="02:14.540"> ever</span><span begin="02:14.700" end="02:15.550"> hear</span><span begin="02:15.720" end="02:16.180"> me</span><span begin="02:16.370" end="02:17.870"> out?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.450" end="02:21.130"><span begin="02:18.450" end="02:19.240">Poison</span><span begin="02:19.440" end="02:19.990"> through</span><span begin="02:20.130" end="02:20.340"> my</span><span begin="02:20.470" end="02:21.130"> veins</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.130" end="02:24.950"><span begin="02:21.130" end="02:21.290">Took</span><span begin="02:21.450" end="02:22.310"> something,</span><span begin="02:22.600" end="02:23.130"> never</span><span begin="02:23.220" end="02:24.720"> explain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.950" end="02:32.950"><span begin="02:24.950" end="02:25.100">Why</span><span begin="02:25.140" end="02:25.680"> can't</span><span begin="02:25.730" end="02:26.360"> nobody</span><span begin="02:26.540" end="02:27.060"> ever</span><span begin="02:27.290" end="02:28.050"> hear</span><span begin="02:28.200" end="02:28.700"> me</span><span begin="02:28.840" end="02:30.340"> out?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.100" end="02:38.980"><span begin="02:34.100" end="02:35.750">Hear</span><span begin="02:35.930" end="0